{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23703","headline":"微之就拜尚书居易续除刑部因书贺意兼咏离怀 · 白居易","name":"微之就拜尚书居易续除刑部因书贺意兼咏离怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我爲宪部入南宫，君作尚书镇浙东。\n老去一时成白首，别来七度换春风。\n簪缨假合虚名在，筋力销磨实事空。\n远地官高亲故少，些些谈笑与谁同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}